SUMMARY:ADORN Holiday Jewelry Market
DESCRIPTION:The North Bay Jewelry Arts Guild invites visitors to its 3rd annual holiday jewelry market show and sale at Chimera Art Space\, Sebastopol. The event features unique\, handcrafted\, wearable art-perfect for gift ving a well as personal collections. Each piece highlights the creativity and skill of our local artisans as they offer this curated selection of jewelry\, from one-of-a-kind necklaces and unique rings to fun bracelets and timeless earrings.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/adorn-holiday-jewelry-market/
LOCATION:Chimera Arts & Maker Space\, 6791 Sebastopol Ave. Suite #180\, Sebastopol\, CA\, 95472\, United States
CATEGORIES:All Ages (Family friendly),Visual Arts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/image2-scaled.jpeg
END:VEVENT
