SUMMARY:Soul Motion®: Body Prayer every Sunday in person
DESCRIPTION:BODY PRAYER IS A FACILITATED EVENT DEVOTED TO INQUIRY INTO EMBODIED CONSCIOUSNESS THROUGH MOVEMENT. \nThis class is offered every Sunday morning\, and led by Zuza Engler or another teacher. It is usually attended by a vibrant & diverse bunch of welcoming and friendly people\, some of whom have practiced Soul Motion® for years\, while some ~ never before. \nWhat to expect \nGuidance and structure are part of every week’s class as we travel across the four landscapes of Soul Motion®:\nDance Infinite (prayer space)\nDance Community (ensemble)\nDance Communion (duet)\nDance Intimate (solo) \nPractices\, structures\, and points of view are offered to facilitate the journey. Participants are invited to travel across all landscapes\, not just their favorite one: dancing by oneself\, in duet\, in ensemble with several people and eventually the whole room\, or witnessing in stillness the beauty of another’s or of everyone’s dance. \nBody Prayer offers a place to be safely uncomfortable as we experiment with ourselves and with each other in our awkward and magnificent dance at the edge of possibility. \nNo experience necessary! Everyone welcome!
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/soul-motion-body-prayer-every-sunday-in-person/2026-11-15/
LOCATION:Wischemann Hall\, 465 Morris St\, Sebastopol\, CA\, 95472\, United States
CATEGORIES:Dance,Health
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/NEWSLETTER-HEADER-2023.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Zuza Engler":MAILTO:angel@zuzaengler.com
GEO:38.4087044;-122.8208227
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Wischemann Hall 465 Morris St Sebastopol CA 95472 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=465 Morris St:geo:-122.8208227,38.4087044
END:VEVENT
