SUMMARY:Sebastopol Growing Together Listening Session
DESCRIPTION:Join your neighbors for an evening of conversation about homes for the people who work and live here and the downtown character that makes Sebastopol special. Choose one of two rooms: Housing Needs and the Renter Experience\, or Downtown Character and the Local Economy. Refreshments\, Spanish interpretation\, and families welcome. Can’t make it? Take the online survey through November 30. Learn more: https://sites.google.com/urbanfieldstudio.com/sebastopol-growing-together/about-the-project
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/sebastopol-growing-together-listening-session/
LOCATION:390 Morris St\, Sebastopol\, CA 95472
CATEGORIES:All Ages (Family friendly),Civic,Community Forum,Free,Se habla español
