SUMMARY:STIMULANT Art exhibition | Meet the artists | tea + conversation
DESCRIPTION:Meet the artists from 12 – 4 PM Tuesday through Friday\, . Get a personal walkthrough of the exhibition from the artists. \nSTIMULANT | Art as Remedy for Diseased Culture is an exhibition of large physical paintings and digital artworks asks: what is really happening in the world\, and why? How are we impacted\, as a society and each of us as individuals? \nThe exhibition explores the idea that art can help heal and renew the personal as well as the collective inner life\, that we can artfully co-create an antidote to personal and societal deterioration\, decay\, and decline. \nJoin the artists for tea\, pastries\, and conversation about the theme of the show\, and how the state of the world is impacting you. See apocalypse.art/stimulant/ for more information.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/stimulant-art-exhibition-meet-the-artists-tea-conversation/2026-11-17/
LOCATION:Laguna Lab\, 117 Morris St\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Adults and teens
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/meet-the-artists-600x400-1.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Apocalypse Studio":MAILTO:song@apocalypse.art
END:VEVENT
