SUMMARY:Art Salon | The Future of Culture\, & the Role and Purpose of Art
DESCRIPTION:Apocalypse Studio will be hosting a Parisian-style art salon on the last night of its major solo art exhibition\, STIMULANT | Art as Remedy for Diseased Culture at Laguna Lab. \nCome to see the exhibition of large physical paintings and digital artworks\, with the Oversoul as the centerpiece — a 144 piece mosaic 10 feet x 15 feet wide of painted panels with digital artwork counterparts. We will give some presentations about the exhibition\, introduce the Apocalypse Studio and share its mission and projects for 2027\, and hold a lightly facilitated conversation about the Future of culture and the role and purpose of art. A light dinner with drinks will be served. Vegetarian options will be available. RSVP by Nov 18; there is limited seating. Please email song@apocalypse.art to RSVP or with questions.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/art-salon-the-future-of-culture-the-role-and-purpose-of-art/
LOCATION:Laguna Lab\, 117 Morris St\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Adults and teens
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/art-salon-1200x800-1.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Apocalypse Studio":MAILTO:song@apocalypse.art
END:VEVENT
