SUMMARY:California Redwood Chorale 20th Anniversary concerts!
DESCRIPTION:The group has grown to 55 singers! We continue to travel internationally. In the spring of 2027\, the California Redwood Chorale will travel to lovely Slovenia to sing. It will be our 13th trip in our 20 year history.\nThis group of skilled singers is known for singing across the choices of choral music\, from “Bohemian Rhapsody” to Mozart! This season we will honor Dolly Parton by singing her tender “Light of a Clear Blue Morning” as well as “Dirait-on” by Morten Lauridsen\, “Chorale: Hymn” by Karl Jenkins\, “I’ll be Seeing You” by Habermann and Fain\, “Ad Astra” by Narverud\, “Time after Time” by Cyndi Lauper\, “O Love” by Elaine Hagenberg\, “The Awakening” by Martin and more! \nManzanita Harmony Men’s Chorus will be guest singers. \n$30 at the door. Cash or Check
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/california-redwood-chorale-20th-anniversary-concerts/
LOCATION:282 S High St\, Sebastopol\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/anniversary-postcard-1.png
ORGANIZER;CN="California Redwood Chorale":MAILTO:gerryschultz3@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
