SUMMARY:The Grateful Gathering: A Thanksgiving Celebration of the Grateful Dead
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a festive celebration of the music of The Grateful Dead\, Jerry Garcia and beyond\, with an All-Star band. \nThis event is a fundraiser for the Sebastopol Center for the Arts. \nMarcus Rezak is a nationally touring guitarist and bandleader known for his explosive improvisation and genre-bending style.\nLeader of the Grateful Dead project Shred Is Dead\, Rezak has collaborated with members of Umphrey’s McGee\, Trey Anastasio Band\, Frank Zappa’s band\, Blues Traveler\, Little Feat\, and more. A Berklee and DePaul graduate\, he brings a deep love of improvisational music and a fearless\, high-energy approach to every performance. \nWith \nAnna Elva (Stu Allen)\nSteve Pile (Phil Lesh\, Terrapin)\nStephanie Salva (Stu Allen\, Tumbleweed Soul)\nSteven Younger (Alamo Mission\, Zigaboo Modeliste)\nSam Betty (Flowstone\, The Might as Well Band)\nMatt Petruska (Flowstone\, The Might as Well Band)
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/the-grateful-gathering-a-thanksgiving-celebration-of-the-grateful-dead/
LOCATION:Sebastopol Center for the Arts\, 282 S High Street\, Sebastopol\, CA
CATEGORIES:Local Activities,Music,Visual Arts
