SUMMARY:Sebastopol Turkey Trot
DESCRIPTION:Fitness. Fun. Community. 🦃 \nStart your Thanksgiving morning with the inaugural Sebastopol Turkey Trot! \nHead to the Sebastopol Community Center for a fun\, festive community run/walk that brings people together while supporting young people right here in our community. \n🏃 5K Run/Walk — Run\, jog\, walk\, or cheer!\n👟 Little Legs 2K — A special 2K course designed just for kids\, giving our youngest runners a chance to get in on the Thanksgiving fun. \nThe Turkey Trot welcomes everyone\, rain or shine\, including Fido. 🐾 We KNOW Fido wants to be there! \nMost importantly\, this event is 100% organized by local volunteers and nonprofits: the Kiwanis Club of Sebastopol\, Sebastopol Grange\, and Sebastopol Lions Club. \nNet proceeds support local youth grants and scholarships. \nSo\, by joining us\, you’re not just getting a 5K—or a 2K— in before the pie comes out of the oven. You’re investing in the next generation. \nHealthy People. Stronger Youth. A Stronger Community. \n📅 Thanksgiving Morning — November 26\, 2026\n⏰ 8:00 AM\n📍 Sebastopol Community Center\n🏃 5K Run/Walk + Little Legs 2K \nBring the family. Bring your friends. Bring the dog. \nRun. Walk. Give Thanks.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/sebastopol-turkey-trot/
LOCATION:390 Morris St\, Sebastopol\, CA 95472
CATEGORIES:All Ages (Family friendly),Exercise/Yoga,Fundraiser
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/IG-Post.1.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Kiwanis Club of Sebastopol":MAILTO:produce@rahus.org
END:VEVENT
