SUMMARY:Olio Nuovo Harvest and Milling Experience at Gold Ridge Organic Farms
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an unforgettable behind-the-scenes journey into the heart of our olive harvest season. This experience offers a rare opportunity to see how our award-winning olive oil is crafted\, from the branches of our olive trees to the first drops of the season’s oil. \nYour journey begins with a guided tour of our 88-acre organic farm. You’ll step into the orchards to watch our expert team harvest fresh olives straight from the trees at their peak of flavor. \nNext\, you’ll visit our state-of-the-art olive oil mill\, where you’ll learn about the milling process and see the olives pressed into vibrant\, fresh Olio Nuovo\, the celebrated “new oil” prized by culinary enthusiasts for its brilliant green hue and robust\, peppery finish. \nThe highlight comes right at the source: tasting fresh Olio Nuovo straight from the mill just moments after the olives are crushed. \nBook now to secure your spot for this rare\, behind-the-scenes look at our harvest traditions. \nImportant Notes:\n*Please wear comfortable shoes suitable for walking on a working farm\n*This outdoor experience may be canceled due to wet weather. Full refund available.
